('01M4D6BHNR7F0F960TD7GA9FCV', '01M4D6BHNM9YGW24SED5D5YRN0', '01M4D6BHNM3M6YTKYE298SZV8H', 0, 1, 1, NULL, 'Confidential working paper: preliminary water tariff scenario assumptions for the 2027 planning cycle. Prepared for internal Programme Office deliberation only. Illustrative demo content. Scenario A assumes current consumption bands; Scenario B models a 10 percent demand reduction with a phased tariff step.', 'en', 82, '\', 'local-hash-256'),
('01M4D6BQ94SGEC605G9YR0QCG1', '01M4D6BP391HP521RHH956AFDR', '01M4D6BQ92635QNEQT42ZGD8X6', 0, 1, 1, NULL, 'PRJ-01a Inception Report
Deliverable D1 of project PRJ-01a, milestone M1. Prepared for the Programme Office under Water Security.
1. Context
Smart Metering Rollout is a delivery project under target O1.T1 (Reduce per capita municipal water consumption to 150 litres per day by 2030). Install smart meters for household and commercial customers in priority cities. The project started on 2024-06-01 and is led by National Water Company.
2. Purpose of this deliverable
This inception report covers scope, governance, and the delivery plan. It is deliverable D1 against milestone M1, due 2025-01-15.
3. Key findings
1. Overall completion of the workstream stands at 55 percent as of the reporting date, broadly in line with the delivery plan.
2. Adoption by the target entities reached 40 percent, measured across the pilot group defined in the inception phase.
3. The main delivery risk is dependency on the data readiness required by O1.T1; a mitigation owner has been assigned and the item is tracked in the project risk log.
4. Recommendations
Sustain the current cadence of fortnightly delivery reviews, close the open acceptance items before milestone M2, and record the lessons learned in EnviroAI so the next phase reuses them.
٥. ملخص تنفيذي (عربي)
يغطي هذا المستند (تقرير التأسيس PRJ-01a) النطاق والحوكمة وخطة التنفيذ. بلغت نسبة الإنجاز 55 بالمئة، وبلغ التبني 40 بالمئة ضمن المجموعة التجريبية. يوصى بمواصلة إيقاع المراجعات النصف شهرية وإغلاق بنود القبول المفتوحة وتسجيل الدروس المستفادة في سيا نكسس.', 'en', 397, '\', 'local-hash-256'),
